WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.076 --> 00:00:14.099
Tina: What was that?

2
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.100
No. I have to get to Hopian.

3
00:00:18.821 --> 00:00:20.041
I have to concentrate.

4
00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:22.222
Tina: I need to be brave.

5
00:00:23.342 --> 00:00:24.602
I need to be strong.

6
00:00:24.622 --> 00:00:30.124
Tina: What would Hopian tell me?

7
00:00:31.212 --> 00:00:32.773
Hopian: You can do it, Tina.

8
00:00:32.793 --> 00:00:36.416
Hopian: Run as fast as the wind.

9
00:00:37.157 --> 00:00:38.718
Take giant leaps.

10
00:00:39.559 --> 00:00:42.481
Hopian: Take giant leaps of imagination.

11
00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:47.405
Tina: Giant leaps leaps of imagination.

12
00:00:47.425 --> 00:00:51.288
Hopian: Leap and run like the wind.

13
00:00:51.308 --> 00:00:54.591
Hopian: Your belief will lead you to me.

14
00:00:55.391 --> 00:00:57.613
Your belief is your strength.

15
00:00:58.694 --> 00:00:59.635
Tina: I do believe!

16
00:01:00.195 --> 00:01:01.036
I am fast!

17
00:01:01.424 --> 00:01:02.364
I am strong!

18
00:01:02.384 --> 00:01:07.106
Tina: One two three!

19
00:01:08.146 --> 00:01:09.366
Faster, Tina, faster!

20
00:01:09.386 --> 00:01:11.787
Tina: I can do it.

21
00:01:12.147 --> 00:01:12.947
I can do it.

22
00:01:14.388 --> 00:01:17.428
Tina: A giant leap a leap of imagination.

23
00:01:19.409 --> 00:01:20.829
Tina: Whee!

24
00:01:20.929 --> 00:01:22.130
This is incredible!

25
00:01:22.150 --> 00:01:26.911
Tina: I'm back!

26
00:01:27.731 --> 00:01:28.251
I'm back!

27
00:01:29.512 --> 00:01:30.352
I can't believe it!

28
00:01:31.768 --> 00:01:33.068
Tina: I remember this tree.

29
00:01:33.829 --> 00:01:35.789
I know how to get to Ginormous from here!

30
00:01:35.809 --> 00:01:42.731
Ha! Tina: If only Brad and Danny could see me now!

31
00:01:43.251 --> 00:01:51.334
Whoo-hoo! Tina: This is more fun than Disneyland!

32
00:01:56.035 --> 00:01:58.236
Tina: It's time to swim!

33
00:02:02.412 --> 00:02:05.134
Tina: Now it's time for another leap of imagination.

34
00:02:05.154 --> 00:02:12.981
Tina: Uh-oh, I don't want to spend too much time in this world!

35
00:02:13.001 --> 00:02:16.183
Tina: I have to leap again before I freeze!

36
00:02:19.426 --> 00:02:20.167
Tina: Go!

37
00:02:20.207 --> 00:02:21.548
Faster, faster!

38
00:02:22.729 --> 00:02:25.311
I'm getting tired, but I have to keep running.

39
00:02:26.452 --> 00:02:27.853
Hopian: Take a giant leap.

40
00:02:28.774 --> 00:02:30.956
Take a leap of imagination.

41
00:02:41.556 --> 00:02:42.056
Tina: I can do it!

42
00:02:42.076 --> 00:02:42.297
Tina: Ow!

43
00:02:42.317 --> 00:02:43.237
I think I twisted my ankle.

44
00:02:43.257 --> 00:02:46.120
Tina: I just have to make one more leap, and I should be in Ginormous.

45
00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:47.721
Tina: Ouch, that hurts!

46
00:02:49.183 --> 00:02:50.844
How am I going to run now?

47
00:02:53.366 --> 00:02:56.549
Brad: Look at the rainbows.

48
00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:59.511
The diamonds are acting like prisms.

49
00:02:59.531 --> 00:03:01.433
Danny: What's a prism?

50
00:03:01.453 --> 00:03:04.055
Brad: It's a triangle-shaped glass.

51
00:03:04.896 --> 00:03:09.120
It separates light into the different colors─ Danny: A rainbow!

52
00:03:11.724 --> 00:03:13.025
Tina: The rainbow will get me there!

53
00:03:13.045 --> 00:03:16.066
Tina: Brad showed us how a diamond acts like a prism.

54
00:03:16.086 --> 00:03:19.167
Tina: It separates light into a rainbow.

55
00:03:20.348 --> 00:03:24.790
I need to find a big diamond.

56
00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:31.973
Tina: Now, just one more leap.

57
00:03:32.833 --> 00:03:35.634
It won't be a very big jump, but I have to try.

58
00:03:35.654 --> 00:03:37.715
Tina: Here I go!

59
00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:44.012
Tina: I don't think I went very far.

60
00:03:44.032 --> 00:03:48.260
Tina: I made it!
